isease. These conditions can arise from poorly managed diabetes and highlight the importance of regular monitoring and adherence to treatment protocols. The presence of hypertension and altered calcium levels further complicates her health status, necessitating a comprehensive approach to her care. [Data: Relationships (13321, 13327, 13367, 12052, 12067)]\"\r\n147,\"# Healthcare Community in Murcia: Endocrinology and Nutrition\n\nThe healthcare community in Murcia is centered around key entities such as Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos, who specializes in endocrinology and nutrition, and the Hospital General Universitario Morales Meseguer. This community is interconnected through various relationships involving medications like Omeprazol and Digoxina, and the management of conditions such as diabetes and sensory-motor polyneuropathy.\n\n## Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos as a central figure\n\nDra. Yamina Suleiman Martos is a key entity in this community, specializing in endocrinology and nutrition. She plays a significant role in managing patients with diabetes and related conditions, providing nutritional support and overseeing treatments for various health issues. Her involvement in the clinical management of diabetes mellitus and bariatric surgery highlights her importance in addressing complex health needs within the community. The relationships she maintains with patients and other healthcare entities underscore her influence in the region's healthcare landscape. [Data: Entities (6666), Relationships (1543, 3732, 15349, 15950, 15948, +more)]\n\n## Omeprazol's role in patient treatment\n\nOmeprazol is a medication that plays a crucial role in managing acid-related disorders for patients in this community. It is particularly significant for those who have undergone gastric bypass surgery, as it can affect the absorption of vitamin B12. The relationship between Omeprazol and Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos indicates that she may prescribe this medication to manage gastrointes